    {
      "id": "claim_79862cedf00242cd8cd1e2eb086aff9f",
      "statement": "Scenario LGD in ECL_Calc is picked via an IF on Segment_Inputs price driver (HPI uses Scenarios column E, CRE uses column F, otherwise 0) and computed as MIN(1,MAX(0,base LGD*(1-LGD sensitivity*price change))). Only Residential Mortgage (HPI) and CRE have a price driver, so only they flex LGD by scenario. EAD is linked unchanged from Segment_Inputs column C, and lifetime ECL (column G) = EAD x lifetime PD x scenario LGD, with block totals 12,434.76 / 13,817.04 / 19,478.13.",
