    {
      "id": "claim_dcda5c4b9b384a7989d98372f1edb7f3",
      "statement": "Allowance_Summary links each segment's three scenario ECLs from ECL_Calc column G (e.g., B6=ECL_Calc!G7, C6=G17, D6=G27) and computes the weighted modeled allowance E as B*Scenarios!$B$6 + C*Scenarios!$B$7 + D*Scenarios!$B$8, totaling 15,238.91. Weighting is applied to per-scenario ECL outputs rather than to macro inputs.",
