    {
      "id": "claim_425f2f69ce4d4506bd5e6533b78b3751",
      "statement": "The qualitative overlay in Allowance_Summary F6:F11 is a hard-coded input (no formula), annotated as a management adjustment approved by the Allowance Committee (Dec-2025); it totals 681.09, can be negative (Auto -33.56), and total allowance G = E + F gives 15,920. The control check F14 = IF(SUMPRODUCT(--(ABS(J6:J11)>0.15))=0,\"OK\",\"REVIEW\") only flags segments whose overlay exceeds 15% of modeled; it does not cap the overlay.",
