      "statement": "The Sensitivity sheet takes the single-scenario ECL totals from Allowance_Summary B12/C12/D12, adds the same overlay (F12), and compares to reported H12: 100% Upside gives 13,115.85 (-2,804.15), 100% Baseline 14,498.13 (-1,421.87), 100% Downside 20,159.22 (+4,239.22, +26.6%). The Annual Report quotes the Downside and Baseline sensitivities (about $20.2bn / +$4.2bn and about -$1.4bn) holding the overlay constant.",
